    "title": "Ron Buck Elk takes 5K at Yellowstone Hustle on Aug. 29, 2026",
    "text": "Ron Buck Elk takes 5K at Yellowstone Hustle on Aug. 29, 2026\nBy\nJ. J. TurnerRon Buck Elk was the winner of the 5K run at the Yellowstone Hustle on Aug. 29, 2026, recording a time of 25:41.3, according to RunSignUp results.\nBuck Elk, listed as being from Hardin, Montana, was recognized as the overall winner.\nThe top female finisher was M. Beck, who completed the course in 26:33.8.\nDanny Leuthold finished second in 25:52.8, and M. Beck was third in 26:33.8.",
